<urn:atm:triage:finding/AY13-QA-013>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AY13-QA-013" ;
  triage:title "req-qa ATM-QA-003: sprint doc under-specifies its own touched-file surface (members.rs, teams.rs, doctor_projection.rs not named in D1-D6)" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr qa-pr1300-r1 (PR #1300, AY.13 doctor team scope). Three files were modified by this branch but are not named anywhere in the sprint doc's Deliverables list (D1-D6) or file enumeration: crates/atm/src/commands/members.rs and crates/atm/src/commands/teams.rs (each needed a mechanical all_teams: false addition to their existing DoctorQuery struct literals), and crates/atm-runtime/src/doctor_projection.rs (the daemon-side Tokio projection that loops per-team roster and attributes presence findings). Both classes of change are judged necessary, correctly-scoped consequences of D1/D2 -- not scope creep -- but the sprint doc under-specifies its own implementation footprint, weakening deliverable traceability for future reviewers." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ay" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
